<description>&lt;p&gt;CAR soldiers have finished Rwanda special forces and basic special operations training, expanding their capabilities. Near the CAR border, navy marines and other troops have neutralised 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters in Lake Chad. The CAR military chief held high-level talks with Rwanda Defence Force leadership, and Rwanda and CAR military chiefs discussed cooperation, while fresh France-Chad ties were noted. A water dispute in central Chad sparked inter-communal fighting that left dozens dead. The conflict recorded 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPcFlLSHpRcG05Y3VMRHhyR1djMmY1RVlhM3RSejd2WVpZNzhXOWE3M285SGxoeVI1VE1TQ2FtQjY5eXZWVmdiVUZibTVKVFdPWUJ5NlNoeEkxNzk3NEhDaWVKYUt0T2tVSEh5TkVmS0Z0bklKRFdYSWRUa3lnSXkwZmFlZzZWMVBCR1cxcU1oRzdRTjFMR0tIS29GLTJWUkI4RHFndXNpOGlKTFJnSERhOGhmaG40Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE9zcHNaVXpldnJmQ1JvMDBLNEZOa2I2RGxQS0pVaHE1eGRpRmRFOExrajBRVTh4ZU4yc2pqZjVMUFpNY0JJRjFPMXRkbVNvUjZsU05vTUMxMHJzNWgwbXcwV2FQONIBY0FVX3lxTE9zcHNaVXpldnJmQ1JvMDBLNEZOa2I2RGxQS0pVaHE1eGRpRmRFOExrajBRVTh4ZU4yc2pqZjVMUFpNY0JJRjFPMXRkbVNvUjZsU05vTUMxMHJzNWgwbXcwV2FQOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPZHJwbzVNOFRQcFoyeWhITGhrZDFFczdROFdaY0Y2emlGXzA2RDRlcjV1czFidU4yMVdFZERXX1F6VXN6MjFSczRCdkVIdzFGV01qSW1hWDgtWGhMSm1LNDNOcm5QZW1HbjJSSnlHLUVXeWZKT0pWb3B2RVlCZjVhdHJzQjVTdEJWWW9qUXRQOXVIai0xSllKUGhpb185bkEtSGhNOWxvSnJwR2dGa2JGY05wczkya3l2WlRhaU1RaTh4UDV1Ymctcg?oc=5&quot;&gt;WKOW&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNU3JXa1VYWTV4SkdpazBG